[
  {
    "text": "每次出差旅行",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 1.212,
    "duration": 1.212
  },
  {
    "text": "是不是都在为带哪个吹风机发愁",
    "start_time": 1.212,
    "end_time": 4.005,
    "duration": 2.792
  },
  {
    "text": "酒店的吹风机",
    "start_time": 4.005,
    "end_time": 5.217,
    "duration": 1.212
  },
  {
    "text": "风小还伤发",
    "start_time": 5.217,
    "end_time": 6.232,
    "duration": 1.015
  },
  {
    "text": "我真的会谢",
    "start_time": 6.232,
    "end_time": 7.247,
    "duration": 1.015
  },
  {
    "text": "还好被我挖到了这个出差神器",
    "start_time": 7.247,
    "end_time": 9.842,
    "duration": 2.595
  },
  {
    "text": "它折起来就比手机大一点点",
    "start_time": 9.842,
    "end_time": 12.239,
    "duration": 2.397
  },
  {
    "text": "放包里",
    "start_time": 12.239,
    "end_time": 13.139,
    "duration": 0.9
  },
  {
    "text": "行李箱里巨省地方",
    "start_time": 13.139,
    "end_time": 14.747,
    "duration": 1.607
  },
  {
    "text": "别看它小",
    "start_time": 14.747,
    "end_time": 15.647,
    "duration": 0.9
  },
  {
    "text": "11万转的风力可不是盖的",
    "start_time": 15.647,
    "end_time": 18.044,
    "duration": 2.397
  },
  {
    "text": "我这长头发",
    "start_time": 18.044,
    "end_time": 19.059,
    "duration": 1.015
  },
  {
    "text": "几分钟就搞定了",
    "start_time": 19.059,
    "end_time": 20.469,
    "duration": 1.41
  },
  {
    "text": "而且它这个屏显调温我真的超爱",
    "start_time": 20.469,
    "end_time": 23.261,
    "duration": 2.792
  },
  {
    "text": "想要什么温度自己调",
    "start_time": 23.261,
    "end_time": 25.066,
    "duration": 1.805
  },
  {
    "text": "清清楚楚",
    "start_time": 25.066,
    "end_time": 25.966,
    "duration": 0.9
  },
  {
    "text": "经常出门的姐妹",
    "start_time": 25.966,
    "end_time": 27.376,
    "duration": 1.41
  },
  {
    "text": "这个颜值高又强悍的小东西",
    "start_time": 27.376,
    "end_time": 29.774,
    "duration": 2.397
  },
  {
    "text": "必须焊在你的行李箱里",
    "start_time": 29.774,
    "end_time": 31.776,
    "duration": 2.002
  }
]